// NEGATIVE CONTROL for zero-ceremony: under --std=c++17 (see .flags) there
// is NO auto-include and NO default namespace preference — full standard
// ceremony applies, so bare `cout` without <iostream> must be rejected
// loudly. Guards the STD_MADC gate on both mechanisms.
